<section class="ambient-grain min-h-screen px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-28 md:py-40 bg-surface overflow-hidden">
  <div class="relative max-w-container-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center page-reveal">

    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <span class="chapter-label text-secondary mb-8 block">
        Chapter 02 · Hardware Experiment
      </span>

      <h1 class="font-headline-xl text-headline-xl md:text-[104px] leading-[0.9] tracking-[-0.06em] mb-10">
        Blokkr
      </h1>

      <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        A physical ritual object for entering deep work and creating a boundary between attention and distraction.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-10">
        <span class="border border-outline px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm">Hardware</span>
        <span class="border border-outline px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm">Prototype Concept</span>
        <span class="border border-outline px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-sm">Deep Work</span>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-full">
          Follow Prototype
        </a>

        <a href="/pages/deep-work-library" class="border border-outline px-8 py-4 rounded-full hover:bg-surface-container transition-all">
          Deep Work Library
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="absolute -inset-8 bg-surface-container-high blur-[90px] rounded-full"></div>

        <div class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant cinematic-card bg-surface-container">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?q=80&w=1800&auto=format&fit=crop"
            alt="Blokkr deep work hardware"
            width="1800"
            height="1200"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale cinematic-image"
          >
        </div>

        <div class="absolute -bottom-10 left-10 right-10 bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl hidden md:block">
          <span class="chapter-label text-secondary block mb-3">Ritual Principle</span>
          <p class="font-headline-md text-headline-md italic leading-tight">
            “Focus is easier when it has a doorway.”
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-32 bg-surface-container-low">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">

    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <span class="chapter-label text-secondary mb-6 block">
        Origin Story
      </span>

      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-[72px] leading-tight">
        Attention needs more than willpower.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8 text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Most focus tools live inside the same screens that distract us. Blokkr explores a different idea: what if entering deep work began with a physical action?
      </p>

      <p>
        The object is imagined as a threshold. A small ritual that tells your environment, your devices, and your mind that the next block of time belongs to focused work.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-32 bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">

    <div class="max-w-4xl mb-24">
      <span class="chapter-label text-secondary mb-6 block">
        Experience
      </span>

      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-[76px] leading-tight">
        Hardware as a boundary for the mind.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-28">

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-6">
          <span class="chapter-label text-secondary mb-5 block">System 01</span>

          <h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">
            Physical Commitment
          </h3>

          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Instead of opening another app, Blokkr begins with a physical gesture. That movement creates a small psychological threshold before deep work.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant cinematic-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?q=80&w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop"
            alt="Physical desk object"
            width="1600"
            height="1000"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale cinematic-image"
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:order-2">
          <span class="chapter-label text-secondary mb-5 block">System 02</span>

          <h3 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg mb-6">
            Focus Windows
          </h3>

          <p class="text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Work sessions become visible, intentional, and finite. Instead of endless work, Blokkr encourages defined windows of concentration and recovery.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:order-1 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant cinematic-card">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500530855697-b586d89ba3ee?q=80&w=1600&auto=format&fit=crop"
            alt="Quiet focus environment"
            width="1600"
            height="1000"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale cinematic-image"
          >
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-32 bg-surface-container-low">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto">

    <div class="max-w-4xl mb-20">
      <span class="chapter-label text-secondary mb-6 block">
        Prototype Roadmap
      </span>

      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-[72px] leading-tight">
        From concept to physical artifact.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-gutter">
      <div class="cinematic-card bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl p-10">
        <span class="chapter-label text-secondary block mb-6">Phase 01</span>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4">Interaction Model</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant">Define the core ritual: how the object starts, pauses, and closes a work session.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cinematic-card bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl p-10">
        <span class="chapter-label text-secondary block mb-6">Phase 02</span>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4">Industrial Form</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant">Explore materials, desk presence, size, lighting, and tactile controls.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cinematic-card bg-surface border border-outline-variant rounded-2xl p-10">
        <span class="chapter-label text-secondary block mb-6">Phase 03</span>
        <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md mb-4">Focus System</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant">Connect ritual, blocking, analytics, and reflection into one intentional workflow.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-margin-mobile md:px-margin-desktop py-32 bg-primary text-on-primary">
  <div class="max-w-container-max mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-gutter items-center">

    <div>
      <span class="chapter-label opacity-70 mb-6 block">
        Follow the Prototype
      </span>

      <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-[76px] leading-tight">
        Help shape the physical side of Ziyu.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-body-lg opacity-80 mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        Blokkr is still an experimental concept. Early supporters can follow the design process, give feedback, and help decide whether this artifact should become real.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
        <a href="/pages/support" class="bg-surface text-on-surface px-7 py-3 rounded-full">
          Become a Founding Member
        </a>

        <a href="/pages/changelog" class="border border-white/30 px-7 py-3 rounded-full">
          Development Log
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

